Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is an absolute monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl just went inside you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a normal transformation, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only got one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're doing this, it's got to be point-blank!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... There were two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Madoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us out of the fun, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've probably figured it out, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all gathering coins together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know why you're after the coins...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...but you're going to start\Ngathering them for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen to what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our team's goal is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We gather coins, and I gain power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that power,\NI make your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if it's money, cars, or women--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something you want, just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I will get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty simple, all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They make it complicated\Non purpose so idiots lose out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to make idiots,\Nlike my friends here, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're important to me, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I heard you showed\Nmy pal Morita a real good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:05:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As the boss, I can't let it slide\Nwhen one of my pals gets roughed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry, but one of\Nyou is going to have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can pick who it'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle killing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Who would do--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, I'll kill all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You just punched two members of our group.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If one of those two ends up\Nbeing dead, how will that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent question, freckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want you to pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You might say it's your rite of passage--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To make sure you're\Na bunch of shitheads like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As a reward for such a great question,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you out of the running, freckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell when I look in your eyes--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you some time to talk things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Be real with yourself,\Nand throw away all your fancy ideals--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of pal I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad those two are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.91,0:06:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so ruthless, but he keeps\Ntalking about how important his pals are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.75,0:06:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,His pals are important to him,\Nand our pals are important to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ironic, but we're\Nkind of the same like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:07:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you smell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in that dry riverbed,\Nabout 200 meters off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have some bad luck, huh?\NGetting caught by someone like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So? What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true. We can't offer up one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot. There's no way you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We got beat this bad by just one of them!\NAnd there's way more this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't run! You've got to face facts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we fight, we're all dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Ikeuchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it, didn't you?!\NThey really kill people!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikeuchi is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think our only option\Nis to offer up a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Their demands are pretty clear,\Nnot a lot of room for negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're much stronger than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If we fight them,\Nthere's no doubt we'll all be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better to lose\None person than all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.91,0:08:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah! That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikeuchi, you're so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--You've accepted the fact that\Nyou might be the one who's chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we fight, we know we'll all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If we decide to offer a sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:09:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,then won't the person that gets chosen\Nbe someone that agreed to the sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's out of the running...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean the one that's chosen...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...will be me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that too much for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not prepared,\Nyou shouldn't say reckless things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, what's up?\NAre you thinking about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah... It's just... I'm having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought a piece of shit\Nlike me would be living this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I did ever went right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I never got along with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:10:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes were always on the ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I guess that's how\NI ended up finding the coin, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone that's here is here\Nbecause there's nowhere else for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Being surrounded by\Na bunch of shitheads like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, nothing has ever made me happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Um... I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn invisible and assassinate their boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he hasn't transformed,\NI think I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You all can run during the commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No. We can't just leave you behind like--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that's not bad.\NI didn't give you enough credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got guts, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But they might have someone on their\Nside that has special sight, like Ikeuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Being invisible isn't necessarily enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair's right. And if we kill him,\Nwe'll be no better than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Think... Think! Maybe I can\Nhold them off while everyone runs...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Isao?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he wanted to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How are your injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't offer up a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I just wanted everyone to be aware...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Aware of how dangerous this situation is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in this terrible situation,\Nand I can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.87,0:12:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true. You have a wonderful power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to grow this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your power to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the weird request, Isao.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They are lovely, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are all these flowers...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, great timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just finished\Npreparations for our escape--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.54,0:13:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Isao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Isao...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,These flowers are... Yes. She's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka... I'll protect you, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,These beautiful flowers have an ominous scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.37,0:13:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair's actions are always based in logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair... Is there anything I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to do something terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good kid, so stay out of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You must realize by now--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.45,0:14:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of people up here,\Nand some of them are too far gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're dealing with them,\Nyou're going to have to get your hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do things that you\Nand our other friends can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Special powers, incredible strength--\Nthese things aren't scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's scary is the people who use those powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I know how dangerous\Nour situation is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:15:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to protect them! I'm ready for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.91,0:15:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to carry\Nthe burden of any more crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.70,0:15:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...we two are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone takes action\Nfor the sake of another,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,even the most pure-hearted\Nperson can turn completely ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been that way with her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They got away? Why weren't you watching them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.95,0:16:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I didn't think they'd run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I took my eyes off them, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm abandoning them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.79,0:16:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and the girl, Yoshioka! Let us join you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where the hell did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burning! They set the mountain on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,One last futile struggle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty big fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Isao! What were the flowers you grew back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's oleander.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of special plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.66,0:16:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it grows all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The flowers are grown\Nin private gardens and parks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Although not many people know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...oleander is a powerful poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And that poison isn't just\Nin its leaves and flowers--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in its smoke, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn... It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you blabbering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is serious, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my friends used\Ntheir ability to grow these flow--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just die on his own?\NWhat the hell is up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you going to do, Madoka?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.45,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka! Aihara! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of this forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.62,0:18:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.45,0:18:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel nauseous, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka! We're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire is getting bigger and bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those flowers poisonous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here!\NEven if it's just those of us that can move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! First the leader ha--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you... forget...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...I will not abandon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Me too!\N--Me too!\N--Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Me too!\N--Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you consider that\Nhe might have headed straight here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,before getting caught up in the smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.45,0:19:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had, that would have been the end of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just bet that he wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet that he'd try to save his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Special powers, incredible strength--\Nthese things aren't scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's scary is the people who use those powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting to scare me, Clair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought you\Nwere just someone I could trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have no idea what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about Elena, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe\Nshe could be a murderous demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.62,0:21:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to think that\Nwas totally ridiculous, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never figure out why\Nshe gave me the coin that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But ever since I met Shuichi,\NI kind of feel like I might know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.83,0:21:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what my sister wanted from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't bare the weight of her crimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.41,0:21:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But she couldn't run from them, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's how it had to be.\NI'm the only one who can save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.16,0:22:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? How's the coin search going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 11: The Price of Resolve"
